  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">African Crop Epidemiology System (ACES)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A pilot initiative &#x2013; building on previous FCDO and BMGF investments &#x2013; to establish the tools, technologies and partnerships required for effective surveillance, early warning and response functions in plant health systems in sub-Saharan Africa. ACES is a consortium partnership of four institutions: the Centre for Agriculture and Biosciences International (CABI) &#x2013; headquartered in the UK, the University of Cambridge, CGIAR-CIMMYT and Scriptoria.</narrative>
  </description>
